            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1480-626, Commercial Angle Door Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a sturdy angle door stop great for many commercial needs, including heavy industrial applications. Superb solid floor mount, with a long lasting black rubber pad to cushion and quiet the contact surface.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1480-626_size.gif?v=1704354533\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1480-626 Angle Door Stop size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with all installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1480-626 Angle Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stop Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Stop Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base: 2-1/2\" x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Brushed Chrome</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: (2) 1/4\" x 1-1/2\" SMS & (2) Plastic Anchors</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1480-626.pdf?v=1704262238\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1480-626 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
